# Game data

- Keep provenance (`source`, `license`, `verifiedAt`) on movie fields.
- Every board cell needs at least 3 valid answers (axis safety).
- Prefer Wikidata / editorial CC0 facts. Never scrape IMDb/TMDb into the catalog.
- Actor aliases belong in `src/data/actors.ts`. Fuzzy match stays last-resort for names with 6+ characters.
- After catalog edits run `npm test` so board solvability and anti-cheat suites still pass.
